dominate in a full-throttle 360\u00b0 showdown.\n\n{1095619955754038}\n\n**Dominate with Power**\n\nStep into the virtual battleground where your monster truck faces unstoppable chaos. Crush rivals, smash obstacles, and dominate the battle in fully immersive action!\n{996565998912231}\n\n**Demolish your Enimes**\n\nFeel the thrill of every crash and smash in fully immersive VR monster truck battles. Experience raw power, epic stunts, and nonstop destruction!\n\n\n{1185868916355563}", "short_description": "Brace yourself to crush, clash, and dominate in the ultimate VR Monster Truck arena! Step into a fully immersive 360\u00b0 world where your monster truck goes head-to-head in fierce, metal-crunching battles. Feel the thunder of the engine, smash through opponents, and perform wild stunts in destructible environments - just pure, adrenaline-pumping action brought to life in virtual reality!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://kidloland.com/vr-privacypolicy.php", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Kidloland", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://kidloland.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "673385183287495"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "38786807007630313"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_